OL,3,GNEWSABuilding work starts on new
OL,4,Ahousing development
OL,5,
OL,6,FConstruction work is starting to turn
OL,7,Fformer government offices into 139 new
OL,8,Fhomes.
OL,10,FWestward, a site at South Hill which
OL,11,Foverlooks St Aubin's Bay will include
OL,12,F35 of the flats for first-time buyers
OL,13,Fthrough shared equity.
OL,15,FThe project is led by Jersey
OL,16,FDevelopment Company (JDC) who said more
OL,17,Fthan half of the shared equity homes
OL,18,Fhave already been sold.
OL,20,FUnder the shared equity scheme buyers
OL,21,Fpurchase 75% of the property, and JDC
OL,22,Fkeeps the remaining 25%.
